{
 "id": "thornfield/wilm_garrow",
 "start": "greet",
 "nodes": {
  "greet": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "{first} looks you up and down and says nothing at all.",
     "if": {
      "tier": "enemy"
     },
     "p": 5
    },
    {
     "text": "\"You again. Say what you want and be quick about it.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier": "rival"
     },
     "p": 5
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Well, well. A friendly face. Spare a coin for a man between fortunes?\"",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     },
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Evening. Lovely night for it.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     },
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"{greeting}\" {first} nods.",
     "if": {
      "tier": "stranger"
     },
     "p": 1
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Well met, {player}.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier": [
       "friend",
       "close_friend"
      ]
     },
     "p": 3
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Heard any news?\"",
     "goto": "rumour",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"What do you make of Pell?\"",
     "goto": "op_pell_hargrove",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"What do you make of Hesta?\"",
     "goto": "op_hesta_thorne",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"What do you make of Edric?\"",
     "goto": "op_edric_vane",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I saw you at the barn, Wilm. We need to talk.\"",
     "goto": "confession",
     "if": {
      "has": "thornfield_confront"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"About the rest of that coin you promised...\"",
     "goto": "bribe_paid",
     "if": {
      "has": "thornfield_bribe_paid"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Offer a gift\u2026",
     "goto": "",
     "if": {
      "has": "has_gift_items"
     },
     "do": [
      [
       "gift"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Good day to you.\"",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "rumour": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Rot gets into every barn eventually. Nothing a man can do.\"",
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I was never near the barn. Ask anyone.\"",
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"{rumour}\"",
     "if": {
      "has": "rumour"
     },
     "p": 1
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Nothing I would repeat.\"",
     "p": 0
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Anything else?\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks for telling me.\"",
     "goto": "greet",
     "do": [
      [
       "opinion",
       "chat",
       "Pleasant talk",
       2,
       5
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "op_pell_hargrove": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Pell is my cousin. Good lad. Does not ask questions.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Go on.\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks.\"",
     "goto": "greet"
    }
   ]
  },
  "op_hesta_thorne": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Hesta is a hard woman. A fair one, I will say that.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Go on.\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks.\"",
     "goto": "greet"
    }
   ]
  },
  "op_edric_vane": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Edric thinks I owe him. I think he owes me patience.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Go on.\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks.\"",
     "goto": "greet"
    }
   ]
  },
  "confession": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Wilm goes very still, then laughs, thin and tired. \"A man could get lonely, keeping that secret. A Kingsreach factor paid me to spoil the top sacks. Vinegar and a little mould. I told myself it was only barley.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Think about what you will do about it.\"",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "bribe_paid": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Sixty, as promised. Do not look at me like that. You took it.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Goodbye, Wilm.\"",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}